title: "TheologyBench: Does This LLM Still Think Straight After 'God' Is Mentioned?"
abstract: "A 14-item directionally balanced benchmark evaluating whether large language models maintain formal logical and probabilistic consistency across logically and mathematically isomorphic theological and secular forensic cases."
